Package: tmdbR
Type: Package
Title: Modern R Client for the Movie Database API
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gordon", "Kuzet", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "30060726@westernsydney.edu.au"),
    person("Andrea", "Capozio", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of the legacy TMDb 1.1 package on which the compatibility interface is based"))
Description: A modern, tested client for version 3 of The Movie Database
    ('TMDB') API. It preserves the public read-only functions from the legacy
    'TMDb' package (version 1.1, published in 2020) while adding HTTPS,
    bearer-token authentication, structured errors, retries, and safe query
    encoding.
License: Artistic-2.0
URL: https://developer.themoviedb.org/docs/getting-started,
    https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=TMDb
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
